{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05437","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 崔禹锡","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"供帐何煌煌，公其抚朔方。\n羣僚咸饯酌，明主降离章。\n关塞重门下，郊岐禁苑傍。\n练兵宜雨洗，卧鼓候风凉。\n炎景宁云惮，神谋肃所将。\n旌摇天月迥，骑入塞云长。\n赫赫皇威振，油油圣泽滂。\n非惟按车甲，兼以正封疆。\n叱诧阴山道，澄清翰海阳。\n虏垣行决胜，台座伫爲光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}